### 8.8 Scan Acceptance Criteria

- Correct total counts.
- Correct completed counts.
- No duplicate concurrent tests.
- No unbounded concurrency.
- One endpoint failure does not abort the batch.
- Cancellation works.
- Progress updates correctly.
- Previously completed tests remain available.
- All terminal states are consistent.

